#: ../panels/appearance/appearance.ui.h:37
#: ../panels/universal-access/zoom-options.ui.h:36
msgid "High"
msgstr "ከፍተኛ"

#: ../panels/appearance/appearance.ui.h:38
msgid ""
"<small>Includes shadows and animations when opening, resizing and switching "
"windows.</small>"
msgstr "<small>በሚከፈት ጊዜ ጥላ እና እንቅስቃሴ: መስኮቶች እንደገና መመጠኛ እና መቀየሪያ ማካተቻ</small>"

#: ../panels/appearance/appearance.ui.h:39
msgid ""
"Some settings have been overriden by an external program, press \"Restore "
"Default Behaviors\"  to reset the behavior and return control to this panel."
msgstr ""
"አንዳንድ ማሰናጃዎች በላያቸው ላይ ተጽፏል በ ውጪ ፕሮግራሞች: ይጫኑ \"ነባር ባህሪውን መመለሻ\"  ባህሪውን እንደ "
"ነበር ለ መመለስ እና መቆጣጠሪያውን ወደ ክፍሉ ለ መመለስ"

